From: local
Subject: [PATCH] autodarkmode adapted for dwm 6.8 + prior patches

Dark/PaperColor light via ~/.config/dwm/.lightmode. Super+t toggles.
SIGHUP re-reads the file. dmenu follows on spawn. Open st windows
are notified with an ST_COLORMODE ClientMessage (no signals).

